Cell["\<\
Here I 13create a list of names corresponding to file paths. 
You will need to insert your local folder where you are storing the output.
For example, in this case for me it is \
\[LineSeparator]\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]/home/giulio/University/PhD/JeccoGt2/\
examples/FullBBB_3p1/\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].
remember the final /
